<title>PAKISTAN: SOCCER-KAZAKHSTAN BEAT PAKISTAN 7-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KAZAKHSTAN BEAT PAKISTAN 7-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan beat</p>
<p>Pakistan 7-0 (halftime 3-0) in an Asian zone group nine World</p>
<p>Cup qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Boulat Esmagambetov 18, Alexei Kalichin 33,</p>
<p>Vladimir Loginov 36, Nourken Mazbaev 53, Viktor Zoubarev 65, 69,</p>
<p>72.</p>
<p>    Standings     P   W   D   L   F    A   PTS</p>
<p> Kazakhstan	 3   3   0   0  12    1    9</p>
<p> Iraq		 2   1   0   1   7    4    3</p>
<p> Pakistan	   3   0   0   3   2   16    0</p>
</text>
